      "message": "Section 3.5 in the datasheet https://www.st.com/resource/en/datasheet/stm32l552ze.pdf does not mention anything other than 256 kB.  The chip I am doing this for is the L552ze version, so if you have seen something that applies to cx but not ze, then please let me know, then it should be modified.",
