      "writtenOn": "2021-08-19T21:21:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Where are the number of DMA channels and I2C port count defined? Are these the same across all L522 chip variants so they can be in the registers-stm32l522.h file?",
      "revId": "9d669d21935a7c3fc47a8d8a8d09790cfa9721d5",
