      "writtenOn": "2021-08-20T21:11:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Table 17 in the datasheet seems to indicate four I2C ports, for all L552 variants.\nLooking around, I was not able to see how other chips declare the number of I2C ports (other than having defines for I2C1_..., I2C2_... and so on), can you elaborate on what I need to add here?",
      "parentUuid": "3cc6bd9a_60ddc12e",
      "revId": "9d669d21935a7c3fc47a8d8a8d09790cfa9721d5",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
