      "writtenOn": "2021-08-24T20:01:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I had these values in the similar file for the G4 chip.\n\n#undef I2C_PORT_COUNT\n#define I2C_PORT_COUNT\t4\n\n/* Number of DMA channels supported (6 channels each for DMA1 and DMA2) */\n#define DMAC_COUNT 12\n\nThere is probably some default define that\u0027s being used now, or possibly you aren\u0027t using the DMA block. But, the DMA block is used by the serial console at least.",
